That is `100`'s mechanism reproduced from a third implementation on the same
committed samples. Over these arms it is harmless: they all compute the same
value, so a flip buys or loses a little time and nothing else.

2. COUNTERFACTUAL: THE SAME NOISE OVER ARMS THAT DISAGREE

   The error column is REAL, computed exactly by p3 at k = 16 against a
   rational reference. The time column is SYNTHETIC, because no committed
   family has arms that disagree. That absence is the finding, not a gap in
   this probe. The noise magnitude is the corpus's own measured floor.

